                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game itself it's pretty nice, perfect to waste some time when you're bored\r\n\r\nBut hey, here's something really funny\r\nAfter that, i use this game for another thing, and i think it's really useful\r\nI have GTA SA with 2 Player Deluxe installed, so i wanted to play with a friend Online, since the mod is Local Only, i couldn't... Until I thought of this\r\n\r\nI went to the files of this game, deleted everything(Except the CloudData folder, for some reason is needed) and put my GTA SA on it, renaming the .exe of the game, since this game is free, only 300mb and has Steam Remote Play, it's perfect for what i wanted, u start the game from Steam like normal with the files replaces with the GTA SA and u can play with a friend with the 2 Players mod using Remote Play, it works so damn well\r\nYou can obviously do this with other games and it will work aswell, 10/10\r\n\r\n(Will anyone read this ever? idk)",
